                    <div class="card p-8">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-heading mb-6 text-primary">Our Story</h2>
                        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6">
                            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">The UMKC Mission:Brain Chapter was founded in 2025 by a group of passionate students and faculty members who recognized the critical need for global neurosurgery health efforts in the Kansas City community. Our chapter emerged from a shared vision to extend the mission of Mission:Brain&#x2014;providing neurosurgical outreach, education, and advocacy&#x2014;into the Kansas City community. </p>
                            <p class="leading-relaxed">
                                As part of the national Mission:Brain organization, we are committed to advancing brain health through education, research support, and community engagement. Our chapter serves as a vital link between the University of Missouri-Kansas City's academic excellence and the broader Kansas City metropolitan area's healthcare needs.
                            </p>
                            <p class="leading-relaxed">
                                What sets our chapter apart is our unique position within a major research university, allowing us to connect students directly with groundbreaking research opportunities while simultaneously serving our community through educational outreach and advocacy programs.
                            </p>
                        </div>
