                            <div class="card p-6 flex-1">
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading mb-2 text-primary">Mission:Brain UMKC Gala: A Night for Aneurysm Awareness

</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600">
                                    The UMKC Chapter of Mission:Brain is proud to host its inaugural Gala in partnership with the Brain Aneurysm Foundation, with all proceeds benefiting the Research Grant Symposium & Support Conference to be held this November in Scotsdale, AZ.
This special evening will bring together students, clinicians, researchers, and community advocates to raise awareness for Ellie’s Law (H.R.902)—a bipartisan bill that seeks to allocate $10 million annually for unruptured brain aneurysm research through the NIH.
The Gala aims not only to fund critical research, but to foster a sense of unity and purpose around a cause that impacts 1 in 50 Americans.
.
